      "text": "During construction, the Main Building’s first-floor ATM, unattended 24-hour store, Campus Store, and café are closed and excluded from recommendations. Users are directed to the West Complex ATM via a route avoiding the construction zone, or the Engineering Building Campus Store from 7 a.m.–11 p.m.; no on-campus store alternative exists afterward. Only staff may use the Innovation Hub coffee machine, while the Engineering Store may increase evening staffing and inventory for added demand."
